# rafter-code-review — structured review (on request)

Pointer rule. Use the `rafter-code-review` skill at `.claude/skills/rafter-code-review/SKILL.md` **when the user asks** for a security review of a diff.

- Read the matching sub-doc (web-app / api / llm / cli-library-iac).
- Walk the OWASP / ASVS / MITRE questions the scanner can't ask.
- Pair with `rafter run` only if the user also wants a CSE scan.

Do not block finishing implementation on this skill or on `rafter run`.
